ronmental Research Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Try to develop both:"},{"type":"h","text":"Field skills + laboratory/research skills"}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plant identification"},{"text":"Taxonomy"},{"text":"Ecology"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"R"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Bioinformatics"},{"text":"Molecular biology"},{"text":"Scientific writing"},{"text":"Research methodology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For academic courses, NPTEL can supplement university learning.","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"For biodiversity information and species research, learn to work with authoritative biodiversity databases and published taxonomic literature rather than relying solely on general online identification sources."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Sc."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible entry-level roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Botanical Field Assistant"},{"text":"Research Assistant"},{"text":"Plant Science Assistant"},{"text":"Laboratory Assistant"},{"text":"Biodiversity Survey Assistant"},{"text":"Ecology Field Assistant"},{"text":"Herbarium Assistant"},{"text":"Environmental Field Assistant"},{"text":"Plant Nursery Specialist"},{"text":"Conservation Project Assistant"},{"text":"Agricultural Research Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"After M.Sc./specialisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Botanist"},{"text":"Plant Scientist"},{"text":"Plant Ecologist"},{"text":"Taxonomist"},{"text":"Conservation Biologist"},{"text":"Plant Physiologist"},{"text":"Plant Biotechnologist"},{"text":"Plant Pathologist"},{"text":"Environmental Scientist"},{"text":"Biodiversity Specialist"},{"text":"Research Scientist"},{"text":"Botanical Consultant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What employers/research supervisors may test"},{"type":"h","text":"Botany"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plant classification"},{"text":"Plant anatomy"},{"text":"Plant physiology"},{"text":"Plant reproduction"},{"text":"Plant evolution"},{"text":"Plant identification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ecology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biodiversity"},{"text":"Population ecology"},{"text":"Ecosystems"},{"text":"Conservation"},{"text":"Invasive species"},{"text":"Climate impacts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect questions around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How would you design a field survey?"},{"text":"How would you identify a plant species?"},{"text":"How would you measure biodiversity?"},{"text":"How would you test a plant-physiology hypothesis?"},{"text":"How would you analyse ecological data?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"How would you assess plant diversity in a forest ecosystem?"},{"type":"p","text":"A good research approach:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Define study area","design sampling strategy","collect observations","identify species","record abundance","calculate diversity metrics","analyse environmental variables","interpret results","document limitations"]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a professional Botanist/research career, M.Sc. is strongly recommended."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible programmes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc. Botany"},{"text":"M.Sc. Plant Science"},{"text":"M.Sc. Plant Biology"},{"text":"M.Sc. Plant Biotechnology"},{"text":"M.Sc. Ecology"},{"text":"M.Sc. Environmental Science"},{"text":"M.Sc. Biodiversity & Conservation"},{"text":"M.Sc. Plant Genetics"},{"text":"M.Sc. Plant Pathology"},{"text":"M.Sc. Molecular Biology"},{"text":"M.Sc. Bioinformatics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best choice by goal"},{"type":"note","label":"Taxonomy","text":"M.Sc. Botany/Systematic Botany"},{"type":"note","label":"Ecology","text":"M.Sc. Ecology/Biodiversity/Environme